"Start with the ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` gain.  Use the :ref:`Transmitter based "
"tuning<common-transmitter-tuning>` feature of ArduCopter. Make the following"
" parameter changes:"
msgstr ""
"从 ``ATC_RAT_xxx_D`` 增益开始。使用 ArduCopter 的 :ref:`发射机调参功能<common-transmitter-"
"tuning>`。进行以下参数更改："

